  The buying plan's current period: state, amount; with room, when, progress and what to buy.
  Small: 8 + 12.9 + 3 + 19.9 + 8 = 52 -> 50. Full: + 3 + 11.7 + 8 + 5 + 6 + 23.4 = 110.
